    {
      "text": "Its body temperature is around 1,100 degrees F. It is healthy if it is breathing yellow flames.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees F.",
      "version": "platinum"
